[[0,1020906,0,18,0,18,"2016-05-04T20:24:33","Gaffots","",[],"","Even through all the blur, you can see the disappointment in his moms eyes.","https://i.sli.mg/TKK4VC.png","NeoFAG"],[1,5106196,0,9,0,9,"2016-05-04T20:51:47","BillBugle","",[],"<p>hopefully the mums present is kicking the tranny out to live in a cardboard box</p>"],[2,5106232,5106196,10,0,10,"2016-05-04T20:54:25","Gaffots","[e]",[],"<p>Sadly his mom paid for his dick removal and was almost broke at one point, all the while not bringing in any money. He said all this on twitter.</p>"],[3,5106786,5106232,7,0,7,"2016-05-04T22:08:59","justanobody","",[],"<p>That can cost upwards of $30,000.</p>\n<p>Granted I've stayed clear of taking shots at Dax for the most part (Though not a fan of their's in the least.) But I'd never be able to get over the guilt of making someone pay that who has their own financial issues.</p>"],[2,5106571,5106196,6,0,6,"2016-05-04T21:42:41","this_somuchthis","",[],"<p>box and a laptop - two echo chambers for the price of one :o</p>"],[1,5106711,0,3,0,3,"2016-05-04T21:59:13","ThisIsWhoWeR","",[],"<p>&quot;Back in the box, you pox from Hell!&quot;</p>"],[1,5106920,0,2,0,2,"2016-05-04T22:25:42","EdSnowden","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>his</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Wait wut?</p>"],[2,5107130,5106920,4,0,4,"2016-05-04T22:56:54","Gaffots","",[],"<p>Dax is a Tranny, a man who chopped off his dick. So yes, his.</p>"],[1,5106963,0,5,0,5,"2016-05-04T22:30:57","Gafsucks","",[],"<p>Is that a box troll? </p>"],[1,5107588,0,1,0,1,"2016-05-04T23:53:26","MegaMalka","",[],"<p>What am I looking at here?</p>"],[2,5107991,5107588,2,0,2,"2016-05-05T00:36:15","Gaffots","",[],"<p>Tranny is a box, with his disappointed mother in the background.</p>"],[1,5108935,0,5,0,5,"2016-05-05T02:41:45","hiex","",[],"<p>Today's my mum's birthday, so here's a picture of <em>me</em>! Aren't I quirky?</p>"],[2,5116962,5108935,2,0,2,"2016-05-05T23:40:17","ThisIsWhoWeR","",[],"<p>Exactly. Must be hard being so narcissistic when you've got nothing to offer the world but Howdy Doody in a cheap Jackie O. wig.</p>"],[1,5109360,0,1,0,1,"2016-05-05T03:46:15","UncleDoug","",[],"<p>UGG boots, one size fits all.</p>"],[2,5116986,5109360,1,0,1,"2016-05-05T23:43:27","ThisIsWhoWeR","",[],"<p>Dax wears UGGO boots.</p>"],[1,5109474,0,2,0,2,"2016-05-05T04:02:02","Phat_Michael","",[],"<p>Her mum looks like John Lithgow. </p>"],[2,5109589,5109474,2,0,2,"2016-05-05T04:21:53","UncleDoug","",[],"<p><a href=\"http://www.forthmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/09/JL_245.jpg\">LOL! Yeah</a></p>"],[2,5116966,5109474,2,0,2,"2016-05-05T23:40:48","ThisIsWhoWeR","",[],"<p>Makes sense, Dax is from outer space.</p>"]]
